    "title_en": "Generalised $Ω$-backgrounds in twisted $N=4$ super Yang-Mills",
    "abstract_en": "We introduce rigid supergravity backgrounds for 4d $\\mathcal{N}=4$ super Yang-Mills which deform its topological twists and generalise the $Ω$-deformation of $\\mathcal{N}=2$ gauge theories. We derive the twisted supersymmetry variations of the $\\mathcal{N}=4$ Weyl multiplet, and the $\\mathcal{N}=4$ matter multiplet coupled to a rigid bosonic background, for each of the three inequivalent topological twists. Other, more exotic backgrounds are also discussed.",
